  "rational_detection": "If the rational Tate cocycle were a coboundary, clear one power of2 in that coboundary. The resulting multiple of Q has trivial Kummer class modulo every2^a. Finite injections put it in every2^a E(Q). In a finitely generated group that intersection consists of odd torsion, contradicting nontorsion."
